  "description": "This is not the recommended package for working with Run, please use the Google.Cloud.Run.V2 package.\n      This Google APIs Client Library for working with Run v2 uses older code generation, and is harder to use.\n\n      Product documentation is available at:\n      https://cloud.google.com/run/\n\n      API reference documentation for this package is available at:\n      https://googleapis.dev/dotnet/Google.Apis.CloudRun.v2/latest/api/Google.Apis.CloudRun.v2.html\n\n      The source code for this package is available at:\n      https://github.com/google/google-api-dotnet-client/tree/master/Src/Generated/Google.Apis.CloudRun.v2\n\n      Supported Platforms:\n      - .NET Framework 4.6.2+\n      - .NET Standard 2.0\n      - .NET 6.0+\n\n      Incompatible platforms:\n      - .NET Framework < 4.6.2\n      - Silverlight\n      - UWP (will build, but is known not to work at runtime)\n      - Xamarin/MAUI\n      - Windows 8 Apps\n      - Windows Phone 8.1\n      - Windows Phone Silverlight 8.0",
